                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "1f51f7f3-b6ac-4848-b5c6-694a138f29a4",
                        "entry_id": "c261a8bf-9289-38d1-b679-8332e7787931",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more frou-frou"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "87aca1ac-4bb6-4a11-a0f5-ad9c45a13c04",
                        "entry_id": "c261a8bf-9289-38d1-b679-8332e7787931",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most frou-frou"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7b21cdce-0ca6-3a9f-b8cb-4b72e51fe9be",
                        "entry_id": "c261a8bf-9289-38d1-b679-8332e7787931",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Liable to create the sound of rustling cloth, similar to 19th-century dresses."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ad191053-291a-3aa1-a7ff-72728c7d5af5",
                        "entry_id": "c261a8bf-9289-38d1-b679-8332e7787931",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Highly ornamented, overly elaborate; excessively girly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd1cae97-5bc5-4b38-8a0b-0af480f87c10",
                                "sense_id": "ad191053-291a-3aa1-a7ff-72728c7d5af5",
                                "text": "They ate in a frou-frou restaurant at the top of a skyscraper."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96ba149a-fce5-44df-8f7b-d7f68457ece7",
                                "sense_id": "ad191053-291a-3aa1-a7ff-72728c7d5af5",
                                "text": "Kinda like a frou-frou dessert at a chichi restaurant, restaurant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "07f7081e-46df-425a-ba3e-ca39581df86b",
                                "sense_id": "ad191053-291a-3aa1-a7ff-72728c7d5af5",
                                "text": "This is a column for a Sunday paper, designed to be absorbed at leisure, over coffee and frou-frou pastries, at around noon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5da89d78-3fab-42e4-a444-1d9c73d076eb",
                                "sense_id": "ad191053-291a-3aa1-a7ff-72728c7d5af5",
                                "text": "For the price of a frou-frou Starbucks drink, a Netflix subscriber could binge this content ad nauseam without suffering through a single commercial – the ideal home viewing experience."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "85bb3878-ff81-3de1-9857-ff2a6f6136a9",
                        "entry_id": "c261a8bf-9289-38d1-b679-8332e7787931",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Unimportant, silly, useless."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f90aefcf-839e-4561-8cc5-6aa074d9d29b",
                                "sense_id": "85bb3878-ff81-3de1-9857-ff2a6f6136a9",
                                "text": "Bob was off faffing about doing frou-frou nonsense whilst Edwina kept her nose to the grindstone."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "375c9f8c-91d3-47a8-a837-ef98f153586c",
                                "sense_id": "85bb3878-ff81-3de1-9857-ff2a6f6136a9",
                                "text": "Barack Obama, out of touch with the working man as usual, has an aggressive program for carbon emissions reductions and has spoken of the need for such frou-frou measures as increased investment in transit infrastructure, intercity rail, and even bicycling."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cc8a5154-20b1-4c14-b400-c7a0217081c8",
                                "sense_id": "85bb3878-ff81-3de1-9857-ff2a6f6136a9",
                                "text": "Dr. Okorie: Those paintings on the walls have a definite effect on people. A very specific definite effect, with wildly variable results. Would you call them de-inhibitors, Lillian?\nDr. Lillihammer: I'd call them cognition divergence vectors. I've already got the paper half-written in my mind.\nDr. Blank: Explain it to us froufrou hard and social scientists.\nDr. Wettle: I'm not froufrou, you're froufrou."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "0c020f17-5433-3917-a21c-27557afd42cb",
                "word": "frou-frou",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "958c507f-efd7-4cd2-8b45-dbf07c74570a",
                        "entry_id": "0c020f17-5433-3917-a21c-27557afd42cb",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "frou-frous"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ae468dd4-191b-33be-9e9d-f250960eeeef",
                        "entry_id": "0c020f17-5433-3917-a21c-27557afd42cb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A rustling sound, particularly the rustling of a large silk dress."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "onomatopoeic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a554d755-8bd3-4c9e-bd36-685679674934",
                                "sense_id": "ae468dd4-191b-33be-9e9d-f250960eeeef",
                                "text": "[…]the frou-frou of life was lost to her[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b661cb7-6e5d-4dec-9d22-be27d505b3c4",
                                "sense_id": "ae468dd4-191b-33be-9e9d-f250960eeeef",
                                "text": "The modern frou-frou of satin and gros-de-Naples skirts is nothing to the rustling of brocaded silks."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "44440de3-ceb8-4f42-a3e4-2fd1caf9aa19",
                                "sense_id": "ae468dd4-191b-33be-9e9d-f250960eeeef",
                                "text": "She was pretty, charming, and, moreover, a widow. And because of this she at once had at heel any number of Eldorado Kings, officials, and adventuring younger sons, whose ears were yearning for the frou-frou of a woman’s skirts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb4afa11-5e54-48af-a860-c33cb26321aa",
                                "sense_id": "ae468dd4-191b-33be-9e9d-f250960eeeef",
                                "text": "“Now, Watson, the fair sex is your department,” said Holmes, with a smile, when the dwindling frou-frou of skirts had ended in the slam of the front door."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c047d4e-178c-41b1-aea9-d4c397c09350",
                                "sense_id": "ae468dd4-191b-33be-9e9d-f250960eeeef",
                                "text": "Lord Grenville took a hasty farewell of the ladies and slipped back into his box, where M. Chauvelin had sat all through this entr’acte, with his eternal snuff-box in his hand, and with his keen pale eyes intently fixed upon a box opposite to him, where, with much frou-frou of silken skirts, much laughter and general stir of curiosity amongst the audience, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d36a82fc-0324-4546-a54a-d21158a0b8b2",
                                "sense_id": "ae468dd4-191b-33be-9e9d-f250960eeeef",
                                "text": "Impervious to the cheap perfumes\n and the frou-frou of young ladies' skirts,\nhe finally and with deepest dread\nplunged ahead, banging in his ignorance\non the keys as if they were a snare drum."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
